1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,650
Hi, we are BlockID, from Sydney.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,760
This is BlockID Business Passport:

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,745
know the business you invest in.

4
00:00:07,745 --> 00:00:10,381
In the next few minutes we'll show the core features,

5
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:12,718
the user flow for investors and for businesses,

6
00:00:12,718 --> 00:00:15,602
the technology underneath, and where the project is today.

7
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,061
Why does this matter?

8
00:00:18,061 --> 00:00:20,423
Investing in a business is hard to follow,

9
00:00:20,423 --> 00:00:22,335
and the numbers are hard to trust.

10
00:00:22,335 --> 00:00:25,257
After you invest, you lose sight of sales,

11
00:00:25,257 --> 00:00:26,788
profit and new shares.

12
00:00:26,788 --> 00:00:28,532
Ownership sits in a spreadsheet,

13
00:00:28,532 --> 00:00:31,038
so your stake can shrink and nobody tells you.

14
00:00:31,038 --> 00:00:33,835
And dividends are slow, or never arrive.

15
00:00:34,778 --> 00:00:37,230
So we built one passport per business.

16
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:39,287
Every investor can understand it,

17
00:00:39,287 --> 00:00:41,033
follow it, own it, get paid,

18
00:00:41,033 --> 00:00:42,778
and check it for themselves.

19
00:00:43,742 --> 00:00:46,828
This is the live app at eth dot blockid dot au,

20
00:00:46,828 --> 00:00:48,075
running on testnet.

21
00:00:48,075 --> 00:00:50,531
There is no sign-up and no wallet to install:

22
00:00:50,531 --> 00:00:53,968
on your first visit you land in a shared demo investor account,

23
00:00:53,968 --> 00:00:54,896
with sample data.

24
00:00:54,896 --> 00:00:57,092
My portfolio shows every business you hold,

25
00:00:57,092 --> 00:00:59,952
what your shares are worth at the latest approved price,

26
00:00:59,952 --> 00:01:02,301
and the dividends already paid to your wallet.

27
00:01:03,266 --> 00:01:04,623
Open a holding.

28
00:01:04,623 --> 00:01:06,449
You see your shares and your stake,

29
00:01:06,449 --> 00:01:09,319
a price that only moves when a new value is checked and

30
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:11,614
approved, the dividends paid to your wallet,

31
00:01:11,614 --> 00:01:13,388
and the business updates: revenue,

32
00:01:13,388 --> 00:01:14,849
gross profit and net result.

33
00:01:14,849 --> 00:01:17,980
Every investor gets the same update at the same time.

34
00:01:18,926 --> 00:01:23,104
Now the business side, which is also how an investor checks any business.

35
00:01:23,104 --> 00:01:24,485
Paste a website.

36
00:01:24,485 --> 00:01:26,117
We check the address first,

37
00:01:26,117 --> 00:01:27,628
then the research starts.

38
00:01:27,628 --> 00:01:30,783
A business can add its own numbers to improve the result.

39
00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:33,261
Research runs step by step,

40
00:01:33,261 --> 00:01:35,360
and each step reports as it finishes:

41
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:37,912
read the website, build the business profile,

42
00:01:37,912 --> 00:01:42,563
find competitors and market data within a fixed budget of web searches, and score.

43
00:01:42,563 --> 00:01:44,896
The research tools hold no keys.

44
00:01:44,896 --> 00:01:47,360
They draft; a person decides.

45
00:01:48,326 --> 00:01:50,893
The result is a plain valuation report:

46
00:01:50,893 --> 00:01:52,209
a grade from A to E,

47
00:01:52,209 --> 00:01:54,052
a business score, and a low,

48
00:01:54,052 --> 00:01:55,302
mid and high value.

49
00:01:55,302 --> 00:01:56,925
Each part explains its score,

50
00:01:56,925 --> 00:01:59,611
and every figure links to the page it came from.

51
00:01:59,611 --> 00:02:02,647
A finding that cites a page we never read is dropped.

52
00:02:02,647 --> 00:02:04,635
No source, no number.

53
00:02:05,594 --> 00:02:08,463
Nothing moves further until a person approves it.

54
00:02:08,463 --> 00:02:12,278
The admin console lists every waiting item in flow order:

55
00:02:12,278 --> 00:02:15,289
valuations, issuance, chain sync, new shares,

56
00:02:15,289 --> 00:02:17,498
dividends, updates and offerings.

57
00:02:17,498 --> 00:02:19,704
Approvals are signed by an admin wallet,

58
00:02:19,704 --> 00:02:22,296
and only then is anything written to the chain.

59
00:02:23,246 --> 00:02:25,757
After approval, a locked-down signing service,

60
00:02:25,757 --> 00:02:27,122
the only part with a key,

61
00:02:27,122 --> 00:02:30,888
creates the share register on BlockID chain and copies it to Ethereum

62
00:02:30,888 --> 00:02:32,198
Hoodi and HashKey Chain.

63
00:02:32,198 --> 00:02:35,022
This cap table is read straight from the chain:

64
00:02:35,022 --> 00:02:37,246
every holder, wallet and share count.

65
00:02:38,210 --> 00:02:41,537
From the same workspace, a business can open a share offering,

66
00:02:41,537 --> 00:02:44,971
and investors see the dilution before any new shares are issued.

67
00:02:44,971 --> 00:02:47,233
A dividend rule is approved once.

68
00:02:47,233 --> 00:02:49,305
After twenty-four hours to cancel,

69
00:02:49,305 --> 00:02:50,950
it is paid to every wallet,

70
00:02:50,950 --> 00:02:52,352
and holders pay no gas.

71
00:02:53,318 --> 00:02:54,234
Check it.

72
00:02:54,234 --> 00:02:55,508
Don't trust us.

73
00:02:55,508 --> 00:02:58,923
The verify page hashes the full report in your browser and compares

74
00:02:58,923 --> 00:03:01,318
it with the hash recorded on three blockchains.

75
00:03:01,318 --> 00:03:02,639
All three match.

76
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:05,556
Now change one number, and the check turns red.

77
00:03:06,506 --> 00:03:09,216
On HashKey Chain we run the real-world asset stack:

78
00:03:09,216 --> 00:03:13,148
identity registry, share token, dividend distributor and cap table anchor,

79
00:03:13,148 --> 00:03:17,079
plus a provenance contract that records who proposed each action and which

80
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:18,089
person approved it.

81
00:03:19,046 --> 00:03:21,129
Investors also back people.

82
00:03:21,129 --> 00:03:23,173
Our second app, BlockID HR,

83
00:03:23,173 --> 00:03:25,141
reviews the founding team.

84
00:03:25,141 --> 00:03:27,534
It reads public professional information,

85
00:03:27,534 --> 00:03:29,110
and a CV when one is given,

86
00:03:29,110 --> 00:03:31,504
then checks each requirement of the role:

87
00:03:31,504 --> 00:03:33,255
met, partly met, or not found,

88
00:03:33,255 --> 00:03:35,415
and whether the evidence is verified.

89
00:03:35,415 --> 00:03:37,564
Not found is never treated as false,

90
00:03:37,564 --> 00:03:39,772
and every score links to its sources.

91
00:03:40,730 --> 00:03:43,222
How it works: research tools draft,

92
00:03:43,222 --> 00:03:44,718
but never touch keys.

93
00:03:44,718 --> 00:03:47,140
A named person approves every valuation,

94
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:51,075
new share and dividend, and no one can approve their own request.

95
00:03:51,075 --> 00:03:53,200
Only then is it written to the chain,

96
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,694
where anyone can check it.

97
00:03:54,694 --> 00:03:56,532
It runs on any EVM chain,

98
00:03:56,532 --> 00:03:58,223
layer one or layer two:

99
00:03:58,223 --> 00:04:01,753
today BlockID Chain, Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

100
00:04:02,702 --> 00:04:03,880
Who builds it?

101
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:07,633
Founder Do Van Long and co-founder Truong Quoc Tuan are both former

102
00:04:07,633 --> 00:04:09,762
CTOs of major Vietnamese corporations,

103
00:04:09,762 --> 00:04:12,283
and both hold Australia's Global Talent visa,

104
00:04:12,283 --> 00:04:15,868
to build global fintech, blockchain and AI products from Sydney.

105
00:04:15,868 --> 00:04:18,994
A strong tech team in Vietnam and a business team in Australia

106
00:04:18,994 --> 00:04:20,657
built this whole system in house,

107
00:04:20,657 --> 00:04:22,321
and it is ready to grow globally.

108
00:04:23,282 --> 00:04:24,817
Where are we today?

109
00:04:24,817 --> 00:04:26,833
The whole flow runs live on testnet,

110
00:04:26,833 --> 00:04:30,193
with fourteen sample listings built from public information,

111
00:04:30,193 --> 00:04:32,881
forty-two share token contracts on three chains,

112
00:04:32,881 --> 00:04:34,841
and every report verified on chain.

113
00:04:34,841 --> 00:04:38,869
Since the Sydney demo we added founding team reviews with CV checks,

114
00:04:38,869 --> 00:04:42,246
an improved valuation model, and terms and privacy pages.

115
00:04:42,246 --> 00:04:45,960
More than five hundred automated tests run on every change.

116
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:47,996
We have no real users yet.

117
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:51,618
Everything you saw runs today on testnet,

118
00:04:51,618 --> 00:04:54,807
across BlockID Chain, Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

119
00:04:54,807 --> 00:04:58,450
We invite Ethereum investors to back our first pilots in Australia and

120
00:04:58,450 --> 00:05:01,676
Vietnam, layer one and layer two teams to run BlockID on their

121
00:05:01,676 --> 00:05:03,394
chain as a real-world-asset case,

122
00:05:03,394 --> 00:05:06,152
and licensed partners to bring custody and offerings.

123
00:05:06,152 --> 00:05:08,188
Know the business you invest in.

124
00:05:08,188 --> 00:05:10,819
Try it at eth dot blockid dot au.

125
00:05:10,819 --> 00:05:11,842
Thank you.
